WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.580
Mornin', everyone!

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.960
Look at this, Nanako! I 
caught a giant beetle!

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.240
Wow, it's humongous!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.610
And just look at those pincers...

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.800
Very impressive!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.250
Y-you can't have him! I found him first!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.750
They're such children...

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.290
It's their first summer as high schoolers.
They should be off doing something exciting...

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.000
Hey! How about we all go 
on another club outing?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.830
Sounds like fun!

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.500
Nanako, there anywhere in 
particular you wanna go?

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:38.330
SPECIAL ISSUE
Best Spots to See Fireflies
in the Tokyo Area
Guidelines and Etiquette

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.830
I've always wanted

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.260
To see real, live fireflies!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.300
Let's go together!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.080
Fireflies, eh?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.290
But do we have a place near here
where they come out this time of year...?

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:44.500
We do!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.210
The only thing is...

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.920
Rumor has it, people have run into
something OTHER than fireflies there...

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.580
That's totally NOT what I was implying!

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.420
Are you afraid of ghosts, Nanako?

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.790
But you wanna go see the fireflies, right?

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.920
But you're afraid of ghosts, yeah?

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.920
I could do this 20 times 
and not get tired of it.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.380
Please don't. She's gonna 
pull a muscle or something.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.460
Kotoba harari

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.580
Kimochi fuwari

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:21.500
Noseru omoitachi

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.080
Koi ni somatteku

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:34.290
Kimi to itara ame no naka 
mo chigatta shizuku ni naru

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.500
Donna moji o tsuzuttara

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.670
Iroasezuni nokoru no deshou?

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.210
Shitterun da

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:48.170
Ima no futari wa tooi ano hi ni naru koto

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.580
Sou desho kamisama

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.080
Marumaru mizu mo konai densha mo

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.670
Motto kono shunkan ga

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:04.670
Douka eien ni tsuzuite

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.710
Nante muri ka na?

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:15.000
Poem 10:
Nanako, Fireflies, and a Test of Courage

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:23.290
Y-you sure there're fireflies
on the other side of these woods...?

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.330
I get the feeling we're more likely
to find ghosts than fireflies...

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.380
Good evening.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.420
I understand why you called me out here...

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.800
However, I don't know how 
to perform exorcisms.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.540
What?! You don't?!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:42.080
I figured we'd be safe as long as
we had Tao-chan with us, but...

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:51.630
K..Kino-chan? Whatcha drawing over there...?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.920
Chopsticks

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.630
Then what were you staring at a second ago?!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.670
Well, anyway... Should we head out?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.080
We can always turn back if 
something weird happens...

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.080
True.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.300
Here's a fun fact: Fireflies 
have been mentioned

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.380
in all kinds of poetry and 
love songs for centuries.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:18.960
Wow~

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.420
That's pretty cool.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.370
"The silent firefly burns more brightly and
passionately than the noisy cicada."

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.450
In other words, people who don't

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.300
necessarily express their feelings out 
loud are usually the most sensitive.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.580
Reminds you of Nanako-chan, doesn't it?

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.670
President! You sure do know a lot!

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.150
Do you enjoy learning these sorts of things?

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.040
Sure do! I figure a girl's gotta be clever
if she wants to get a man.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.290
I ALWAYS tune in to the 
late-night radio shows!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.130
That's where you're getting 
all your information from...?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.250
Oh, Nanako! There's an owl!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.960
Whoa! Look how far he turned his head!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.580
This is bad... If I don't do something quick,
my plan might fail...

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.140
A test of courage?

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.540
Yep!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:12.540
They're first-years. Don't you just wanna nudge them
a tiny bit closer to adulthood?

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:15.750
But... why do I have to 
help those love birds-

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:19.110
I mean, you're obviously 
the best man for the job!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.960
I am...? Wait, you didn't answer my question.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.130
Why do you want me-

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:26.750
Please?

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.830
I suppose I've got no choice...

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.750
Th-this is terrible!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.290
What's wrong, Tao?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.500
I-i-if we proceed any further in this direction,
I predict that something horrible will happen!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.250
'Cause there's a cliff!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.000
I get it! You were tryin' to 
mess with us, weren't you?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.630
Honestly, she's an awful actress...

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.830
Whoa... I'm gettin' some spooky 
vibes from this place...

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.290
There's a pond just through this tunnel
where we can see fireflies!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.080
Wh-what's wrong, Kino?!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:24.080
Oh, God! What if there's something
in there that only Kino-chan can see?!

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:32.290
So, you think you can do that 
when we get to the tunnel?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.080
OK!

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.750
H-hey, Kino!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.170
What was I doing just now...?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.170
She's WAY too good at this...

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.210
Don't worry, Nanako!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.960
I'll come in with a couple combos and
hit 'em with a takedown!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.960
I don't imagine that would 
work on a ghost, though...

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.230
It's alright, you guys!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:09.650
I brought a good luck charm and

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:10.790
A big bag of salt!

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:14.750
Oh yeah? Then maybe I can 
pelt 'em with rock salt!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.920
Again, that's not going to work on a ghost!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.330
Th-this whole situation doesn't
bother you, Yukishiro-san?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.990
It's pretty scary,

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.320
But it'll be worth it to

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.480
See real fireflies!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.750
I-if you say so...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:46.880
Score!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.380
H-h-hold on... Who made 
that noise just now...?

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:51.790
Miss Presi-!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.080
H-hey, where's Kino?!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.880
I-is this for real?!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.330
Wh-wh-what's going on...?!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.210
God, that was scary!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.540
Huh? Guess we made it outta 
the tunnel at some point...

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.030
Hey! Look at that, Nanako!

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.000
Karai Pond

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.290
We're finally at the pond!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.690
Y-y-y-yeah, but...

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:03.060
We have to go back there and

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.170
Help everybody!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.880
Y-you're right!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.840
Sorry, Nanako-chan!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.580
Miss President asked me to dress up
as a ghost for your test of courage.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:19.420
HUGE SUCCESS!

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.000
What'd you think?! Were you scared?!

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.870
It was a huge success!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.330
I would appreciate it if you'd let me in
on these things beforehand.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.330
There was no need to fool me, too.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.920
Sorry, sorry! It was kinda 
funny though, wasn't it?

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.500
It absolutely was not!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.920
Jeez, you guys... Why'd 
you put us through all-

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:36.170
Alrighty! Let's go find some fireflies!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.580
Nothin' here...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.880
Guess there's not much we can do...

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.880
Should we head back...?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.790
Whoa, I saw one! Nanako, look-

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.580
Oh, it was just your phone!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.210
I can't believe you got 
me with such a lame trick!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.330
I really thought it was a firefl-

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:18.460
Look!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.290
There're a TON of 'em!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.130
Man, I'm so psyched!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.220
Wh-wh-what do we do?! 
Should we take pictures?!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.000
No, we're the Literature 
Club! We gotta write a poem!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.260
They look like green snow!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.580
To put it another way,

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.900
They look like green dust!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:54.130
Go on! Gotta do it while 
it's fresh in your mind!

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.380
I'm so glad you're here...

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:03.750
"The silent firefly burns more brightly and
passionately than the noisy cicada."

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.290
In other words, people 
who don't express their

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.140
feelings out loud are 
usually the most sensitive.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.000
Reminds you of Nanako-chan, doesn't it?

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.330
All done? Lemme read it!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.790
Hey, what're you hidin' it for?

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:25.920
It's a secret...

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.250
Whaddya mean, a secret?!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.710
Just let me see!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.830
Wha- Hey! Wait a second! Nanako!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.620
Nope! No way, Ei-chan!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.360
It's a secret, and that's that!

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.290
You don't get to see!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.710
Wow, how'd you write all 
that while runnin' around?!

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:44.880
Hey, c'mon...!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.480
I'm so glad you're here...

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.010
I couldn't be happier

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.310
To share this with you!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:08.630
Waracchau kurai mattaku chigau watashitachi

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:14.000
Show window utsuru sugata sae

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:19.670
Taiyou mitai ni anata ga hohoemu to

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:28.210
Odayaka na kuuki ga nagareru

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:35.420
Arikitari na nichijou de sae mo

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:41.000
Anata to nara kagayakidasu

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:44.460
Tatoe nani ga okita toshitemo

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.630
Tamani kizutsuki kizutsuketemo

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:54.960
Nanigenai hi o shinjiteite

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.450
On the next epi-

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:01.740
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.730
Watching the Fire-

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:03.740
-works with You!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.040
Next Time, Poem 11
"Watching the Fireworks with You"
